      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "10 tr by 6 rounds = 10 x 10 cm in open mesh with a 4 mm hook after blocking. The mesh opens up noticeably with blocking, so always swatch and block before measuring."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finished size"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Approximately 76 cm circumference by 40 cm tall after blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ch: chain"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "tr (UK): treble"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                        "attrs": {
                          "termSlug": "open-mesh"
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "open mesh"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": tr, ch 2, skip 2, repeat"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "sl st: slip stitch"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 120. Sl st to first ch to form a ring, checking the chain is not twisted."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 5 (counts as tr plus ch 2). *Skip 2 ch, tr into the next ch, ch 2*. Repeat around. Sl st to the 3rd ch of the starting ch-5. (40 tr, 40 ch-2 spaces.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 5 (counts as tr plus ch 2). *Skip the ch-2 space, tr into the next tr, ch 2*. Repeat around. Sl st to 3rd ch of starting ch-5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Round 2 for 40 rounds in total. Fasten off. Weave in ends. Wet block to finished dimensions."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
